# Third-party artwork

PVE VDI includes the following brand assets and illustrations.

## Element Plus empty-state SVG

- File: `src/renderer/src/assets/el-empty.svg`
- Source artwork: https://github.com/element-plus/element-plus/blob/dev/packages/components/empty/src/img-empty.vue
- Project: Element Plus, the Vue 3 UI component library
- License: MIT
- Usage: empty-state and error-state placeholder illustration, vendored from the official component.

## Proxmox VE mark

- File: `src/renderer/src/assets/proxmox-logo.png`
- Source: https://github.com/proxmox/pve-manager/blob/master/www/images/logo-128.png
- Proxmox is a registered trademark of Proxmox Server Solutions GmbH.
- Usage: fallback OS icon when no specific operating-system icon is available.

## OS brand icons

Brand paths in `src/renderer/src/components/os-icon.tsx` come from Simple Icons
(CC0 1.0); the Windows mark is rendered through `react-icons` (Font Awesome
Brands). Operating-system names and logos are trademarks of their respective
owners.
